      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "去雜訊強度越高，改變越大。\n步驟數越多步，生成的背景越詳細。\n使用人物LORA建議\"去雜訊強度\"設定為0.5以上。\n\nThe higher the \"denoise\", the greater the change.\nThe more steps involved, the more detailed the generated background will be.\nWhen using the character Lora, it is recommended to set the \"Noise Reduction Strength\" to 0.5 or higher."
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -33.08449435446153,
        2562.933161301865
      ],
      "size": [
        642.7072895720837,
        327.3272866843581
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 13,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "guide_size建議在512~1024範圍之間，數字越大速度越慢。如果面部修復功能沒有生效時，需提高guide_size的數字。\n或是重啟comfyui。\n\nFaceDetailer功能本身有bug，有些圖片可能無法讀取到人物面部會導致黑畫面。\n\n調整\"denoise\"可以控制面部重繪的幅度。\n\n\n\nThe guide size is recommended to be between 512 and 1024; the larger the number, the slower the speed.\nIf the facial repair function is ineffective, the guide_size number needs to be increased.\nOr restart comfyui.\n\nThe \"FaceDetailer\" feature itself has a bug; it may fail to read faces in some images, resulting in a black screen.\n\nAdjusting \"denoise\" controls the extent of facial redrawing.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
