      "widgets_values": [
        "此處只寫與臉部描述相關的提示詞，和整體照片品質的提示詞。\n可使用人物lora。\n某些圖片可能會無法辨識臉部，導致\"FaceDetailer\"的功能失效。\n人物臉部在照片整體中佔比太小時也會讀取不到，無法進行修復.\n\nThis section only includes prompts related to facial descriptions and overall photo quality.\nThe character Lora can be used.\nSome images may fail to recognize faces, causing the \"FaceDetailer\" function to malfunction.\n\nIf the face occupies too small a proportion of the overall photo, it may not be detected and cannot be repaired."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
